  "totalBlocks": 94,
  "translatedBlocks": 94,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "123a42d79c31c772",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们将通过示例介绍如何开始使用 PatchTST。首先，我们将在 Electricity 数据上展示 PatchTST 的预测能力。随后，我们将使用先前训练好的模型，在电力变压器（ETTh1）数据集上进行零样本预测，以展示 PatchTST 的迁移学习能力。零样本预测性能指的是模型在目标域上的测试性能，且模型未在目标域上进行任何训练。之后，我们将在目标数据的训练部分上对预训练模型进行线性探测，然后进行微调，并在目标数据的测试部分上验证其预测性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0906f9a0d89dfc75",
      "translationZh": "PatchTST 模型由 Yuqi Nie、Nam H. Nguyen、Phanwadee Sinthong 和 Jayant Kalagnanam 在论文《一个时间序列抵得上 64 个词：使用 Transformer 进行长期预测》中提出，并在 ICLR 2023 上发表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "603020c77886fba3",
      "translationZh": "PatchTST 概览",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f2f6ce40d52ab77",
      "translationZh": "从整体上看，该模型将一个批次中的各个时间序列划分为给定大小的片段并向量化，通过 Transformer 对由此得到的向量序列进行编码，然后通过适当的输出头，输出指定预测长度的预测结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d26461486c2805ae",
      "translationZh": "该模型基于两个关键组成部分：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d0465d3c96fa3ee2",
      "translationZh": "将时间序列分割为子序列级别的片段，作为 Transformer 的输入词元；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "649417bbec659c97",
      "translationZh": "通道独立性：每个通道包含一个单变量时间序列，所有序列共享相同的嵌入和 Transformer 权重，即一个全局单变量模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69aaf43dea6ffe6e",
      "translationZh": "这种分片设计自然带来了三方面的好处：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cce8bc082a9479b5",
      "translationZh": "嵌入中保留了局部语义信息；",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e28c99eca9cf33f0",
      "translationZh": "在回看窗口相同的情况下，通过设置分块之间的步长，注意力图的计算量和内存占用按平方级减少；并且",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf0a07a13fa4ab78",
      "translationZh": "通过在分块长度（输入向量大小）与上下文长度（序列数量）之间进行权衡，模型可以关注更长的历史。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd7b7ba5609efad9",
      "translationZh": "此外，PatchTST 采用模块化设计，可无缝支持掩码时间序列预训练和直接时间序列预测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "961bb2ab8e40f3fd",
      "translationZh": "(a) PatchTST 模型概览：一批 MMM 个时间序列，每个序列的长度均为 LLL，通过 Transformer 主干网络独立处理（通过重塑将其放入批次维度），然后将所得批次重塑回 MM M 个预测长度为 TTT 的序列。每个单变量序列既可以采用监督学习方式处理 (b)，即使用分块后的向量集合输出完整预测长度的结果；也可以采用自监督学习方式处理 (c)，即预测被掩码的分块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3fc54aa5390dc2c",
      "translationZh": "安装",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5da6ffce0e55f47",
      "translationZh": "此演示需要使用 Hugging Face Transformers 来实现模型，并使用 IBM tsfm 软件包进行辅助数据预处理。我们可以通过克隆 tsfm 仓库并按照以下步骤操作来安装两者。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f94494383d411804",
      "translationZh": "克隆公开的 IBM Time Series Foundation Model Repository tsfm。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58423fb374814e0b",
      "translationZh": "安装 Hugging Face Transformers",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f28973295c0cbc79",
      "translationZh": "在 python 终端中使用以下命令进行测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c4bee026570ae6dd",
      "translationZh": "第 1 部分：在 Electricity 数据集上进行预测",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "498969c97ea1f30f",
      "translationZh": "这里，我们直接在 Electricity 数据集（可从 https://github.com/zhouhaoyi/Informer2020 获取）上训练一个 PatchTST 模型，并评估其性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0eda1bf9459a8e17",
      "translationZh": "设置随机种子",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9b38594c1eb1593e",
      "translationZh": "加载并准备数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "99bf8a5a64a75b26",
      "translationZh": "在下一个单元格中，请根据你的应用需求调整以下参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42a7d6c65ab6fd9e",
      "translationZh": "dataset_path：本地 .csv 文件的路径，或包含所需数据的 csv 文件的网址。数据通过 pandas 加载，因此支持 pd.read_csv 所支持的所有输入形式：(https://pandas.pydata.org/pandas-docs/stable/reference/api/pandas.read_csv.html)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40ee4458ac86350a",
      "translationZh": "timestamp_column：包含时间戳信息的列名，如果不存在这样的列，则使用 None。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13dbf2692d025e41",
      "translationZh": "id_columns：列名列表，用于指定不同时间序列的 ID。如果不存在 ID 列，则使用 []。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fc4da2731fe70a1",
      "translationZh": "forecast_columns：需要建模的列的列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56d1595247b5b73f",
      "translationZh": "context_length：用作模型输入的历史数据量。将从输入数据框中提取长度等于 context_length 的输入时间序列数据窗口。对于包含多个时间序列的数据集，创建上下文窗口时会确保每个窗口都位于单个时间序列（即单个 ID）内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9e1f7569a926952e",
      "translationZh": "forecast_horizon：需要预测的未来时间戳数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a14bfac75e9ff44",
      "translationZh": "train_start_index, train_end_index：已加载数据中用于界定训练数据的起始索引和结束索引。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5943e0a4cd6addc9",
      "translationZh": "valid_start_index, eval_end_index：已加载数据中用于界定验证数据的起始索引和结束索引。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1af6274a9539665",
      "translationZh": "test_start_index, eval_end_index：已加载数据中用于界定测试数据的起始索引和结束索引。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d78dadfe8a36885",
      "translationZh": "patch_length：PatchTST 模型的片段长度。建议选择能够整除 context_length 的值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dab7d1da962311b9",
      "translationZh": "num_workers：PyTorch 数据加载器中的 CPU 工作进程数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f58947c2532745b4",
      "translationZh": "batch_size：批次大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e29082d04c089d5",
      "translationZh": "首先将数据加载到 Pandas 数据帧中，并划分为训练集、验证集和测试集。然后，将这些 Pandas 数据帧转换为训练所需的相应 PyTorch 数据集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1db194837c4d4ff",
      "translationZh": "配置 PatchTST 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b7dec81d57892cc",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们使用一组配置来实例化一个随机初始化的 PatchTST 模型。下面的设置控制与模型架构相关的各个超参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f37f27594a8219fc",
      "translationZh": "num_input_channels：时间序列数据中的输入通道数（或维度数）。该值会自动设置为预测列的数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "abc32f7b15f3ecd7",
      "translationZh": "context_length：如上所述，用作模型输入的历史数据量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "851bffe1710f79cd",
      "translationZh": "patch_length：从上下文窗口（长度为 context_length）中提取的片段的长度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b583f60d95a40f9e",
      "translationZh": "patch_stride：从上下文窗口中提取片段时使用的步长。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc10225285f01f7b",
      "translationZh": "random_mask_ratio：在模型预训练中被完全掩码的输入片段所占的比例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a93e39247afaf09d",
      "translationZh": "d_model：transformer 层的维度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7956100fb772086",
      "translationZh": "num_attention_heads：Transformer 编码器中每个注意力层的注意力头数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb7aa0dba18e69bd",
      "translationZh": "num_hidden_layers：编码器层的数量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e96c215161e8b0ae",
      "translationZh": "ffn_dim：编码器中间层（通常称为前馈层）的维度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17fcc8e1100cf0d5",
      "translationZh": "dropout：编码器中所有全连接层的 Dropout 概率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "265cf8184ba21830",
      "translationZh": "head_dropout：模型头部使用的 Dropout 概率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "af27a3111f0cdc9b",
      "translationZh": "pooling_type：嵌入的池化方式。支持 \"mean\"、\"max\" 和 None。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e077a226fd79e49",
      "translationZh": "channel_attention：激活 Transformer 中的通道注意力模块，使各通道能够相互关注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c344c8c4f8ca7ac7",
      "translationZh": "scaling：是否通过 \"mean\" 缩放器或 \"std\" 缩放器对输入目标进行缩放；若为 None，则不使用缩放器。若为 True，则将缩放器设为 \"mean\"。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84d9867c02494702",
      "translationZh": "loss：模型中与 distribution_output 头部相对应的损失函数。对于参数化分布，使用负对数似然（\"nll\"）；对于点估计，使用均方误差 \"mse\"。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8afaa4192d90a474",
      "translationZh": "pre_norm：如果 pre_norm 设为 True，则在自注意力之前应用归一化。否则，在残差块之后应用归一化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b1dbaaa958e40c6",
      "translationZh": "norm_type：每个 Transformer 层的归一化方式。可以是 \"BatchNorm\" 或 \"LayerNorm\"。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12a9fe793b0ee929",
      "translationZh": "有关参数的完整详情，请参阅文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "44d9b426d2dd74f7",
      "translationZh": "训练模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f70d3096805c4ad",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们可以利用 Hugging Face 的 Trainer 类，基于直接预测策略训练模型。我们首先定义 TrainingArguments，其中列出了训练所需的各种超参数，例如训练轮数、学习率等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fff7a2d7d622340f",
      "translationZh": "训练轮次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ffb9060aa0501fb",
      "translationZh": "训练损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d40709dfe1cc6478",
      "translationZh": "验证损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "541476240f5a0d51",
      "translationZh": "在源域的测试集上评估模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ab1b99d74107dad",
      "translationZh": "接下来，我们可以利用 trainer.evaluate() 计算测试指标。虽然这并非本任务中用于评判的目标指标，但它可以提供一项合理的检查，以确认预训练模型已得到正确训练。请注意，PatchTST 的训练损失和评估损失均为均方误差（MSE）损失。因此，在后续所有评估实验中，我们都不再单独计算 MSE 指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3318545b87040e8",
      "translationZh": "MSE 为 0.131，与 PatchTST 原始论文中报告的 Electricity 数据集上的数值非常接近。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f1bf0e414608732f",
      "translationZh": "保存模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be864a4dde2ca317",
      "translationZh": "第 2 部分：从 Electricity 到 ETTh1 的迁移学习",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d8f01a5d14079f1",
      "translationZh": "在本节中，我们将展示 PatchTST 模型的迁移学习能力。我们使用在 Electricity 数据集上预训练的模型，对 ETTh1 数据集进行零样本预测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ecf770e303bb3bf",
      "translationZh": "这里所说的迁移学习，是指我们首先在源数据集上针对预测任务对模型进行预训练（上文中我们已在 Electricity 数据集上完成这一步）。然后，我们将使用预训练模型在目标数据集上进行零样本预测。所谓零样本，是指我们在不进行任何额外训练的情况下，测试模型在目标域中的性能。我们希望模型通过预训练获得了足够的知识，并且这些知识能够迁移到另一个数据集。随后，我们将在目标数据的训练集上对预训练模型进行线性探测，然后进行微调，并在目标数据的测试集上验证预测性能。在本例中，源数据集是 Electricity 数据集，目标数据集是 ETTh1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80cec8844bca922e",
      "translationZh": "在 ETTh1 数据上进行迁移学习。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c82fab57618bfa9",
      "translationZh": "所有评估均在 ETTh1 数据的测试部分上进行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00154dd5eae8b66d",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：直接评估在 Electricity 上预训练的模型。这就是零样本性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ec661c7b031256c",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：在线性探测后进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e769328082d151b",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：完成全量微调后进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5a2bfda9c8c34fe3",
      "translationZh": "加载 ETTh 数据集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b95fa5c1bbd9022a",
      "translationZh": "下面，我们将 ETTh1 数据集加载为 Pandas 数据帧。接着，我们将其划分为训练集、验证集和测试集这 3 个子集。然后，我们利用 TimeSeriesPreprocessor 类处理每个子集，使其适用于模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3f626ff1bebf5dd",
      "translationZh": "在 ETTH 上进行零样本预测",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a2e154ecb113a47",
      "translationZh": "由于我们要测试模型开箱即用的预测性能，因此加载上面预训练好的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "268cbb413bff85ba",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，采用零样本预测方法，我们得到的 MSE 为 0.370，接近原始 PatchTST 论文中的最先进结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d8de58c8f79096b",
      "translationZh": "接下来，让我们看看进行线性探测能取得怎样的效果。线性探测是在冻结的预训练模型之上训练一个线性层，通常用于测试预训练模型所提取特征的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "12ebfe8753bccc99",
      "translationZh": "在 ETTh1 上进行线性探测",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1242f1967128b002",
      "translationZh": "我们可以在目标数据的训练部分上快速进行线性探测，看看是否能提升测试性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fff7a2d7d622340f",
      "translationZh": "训练轮次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ffb9060aa0501fb",
      "translationZh": "训练损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d40709dfe1cc6478",
      "translationZh": "验证损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fa902419ca1e784",
      "translationZh": "可以看到，仅在冻结的骨干网络之上训练一个简单的线性层，MSE 就从 0.370 降至 0.357，超越了最初报告的结果！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0c9b3336c8070fa",
      "translationZh": "最后，让我们看看对模型进行全量微调能否带来进一步的提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0657aa6d6d00d0d6",
      "translationZh": "在 ETTh1 上进行全量微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ca49e55a0f24637",
      "translationZh": "我们可以在目标数据的训练部分上对整个模型进行微调（而不是像上面那样对最后一个线性层进行探测），看看是否能提升测试性能。代码与上面的线性探测任务类似，区别在于我们不冻结任何参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fff7a2d7d622340f",
      "translationZh": "训练轮次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ffb9060aa0501fb",
      "translationZh": "训练损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d40709dfe1cc6478",
      "translationZh": "验证损失",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b73c266ce60a751d",
      "translationZh": "在这个案例中，全量微调在 ETTh1 数据集上仅带来了小幅提升。对于其他数据集，可能会有更显著的提升。不管怎样，我们还是把模型保存下来吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e76a94ac8320d51",
      "translationZh": "总结",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f370189e7cc877e",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们逐步介绍了如何训练 PatchTST 来完成预测和迁移学习相关任务，并展示了多种微调方法。我们旨在帮助你轻松地将 PatchTST HF 模型集成到你的预测应用场景中，也希望本文能成为有用的参考资源，帮助你更快地采用 PatchTST。感谢你阅读我们的博客，希望这些信息能对你的项目有所帮助。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
